# Harkonnen saboteurs and harvester worms (scripts/check_saboteurs.sh): the
# setup (dune_story_setup=saboteurs) lets days pass until the saboteurs
# damage a miner's harvester, shows the chief's message, contacts the troop
# over the map (its lines, the greyed MODIFY EQUIPMENT, a refused order),
# passes the day to the repair, sends an army troop to find the saboteurs,
# then lets worms come to two harvesters (one with an orni); everything
# happens during the setup.
#
# Comments after '#' on a command line say what a click hits and what a
# wait lets finish; scripts/dune_script_trace.py prints what each line did.
wait 15000              # the story setup runs (the days pass, the contacts, the hunt, the worms)
checkpoint saboteurs-end
quit
